This updated version restores the full feature set—campaign themes, dynamic workload monitoring, and brief management—while maintaining strict adherence to safe DOM creation methods.

Save this as an `.html` file.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Professional Content Planner</title>
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #4f46e5; --border: #e2e8f0; --warn: #ef4444; --success: #10b981; }
